### Generic Consent Data Enrichment + Flow Manager prepare demo
### Select the "local" environment from http/client.env.json.
### ACCOUNT_INFORMATION / ACCOUNT_LIST below are DEMO configuration values, not hard-coded framework types.

### 1. Ensure demo consent type exists in Reference & Configuration
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reference/consent-types
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Actor-Type: {{actorType}}
X-Source-System: {{sourceSystem}}

{
  "code": "ACCOUNT_INFORMATION",
  "displayName": "Account Information",
  "description": "Demo consent type for generic data enrichment",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "contentSchema": {},
  "active": true
}

### 2. Configure registration policy (no trusted auto-authorization)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/policies/consent-types
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Actor-Type: {{actorType}}
X-Source-System: {{sourceSystem}}

{
  "consentType": "ACCOUNT_INFORMATION",
  "evidencePolicy": "NOT_REQUIRED",
  "maxValidityDays": 365,
  "requireSubject": true,
  "allowTrustedAutoAuthorization": false,
  "allowedChannels": ["WEB", "MOBILE"]
}

### 3. Configure a generic mock backend provider
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reference/data-enrichment/providers
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Actor-Type: {{actorType}}
X-Source-System: {{sourceSystem}}

{
  "providerCode": "MOCK_ACCOUNT_BACKEND",
  "providerType": "MOCK",
  "adapterKey": "CONFIGURED_MOCK",
  "endpointTemplate": null,
  "httpMethod": null,
  "credentialReference": null,
  "timeoutMs": 1000,
  "configuration": {
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "candidates": [
      {
        "id": "A001",
        "resourceType": "ACCOUNT",
        "label": "Current account ****1234",
        "attributes": {"currency": "VND", "productType": "CURRENT"}
      },
      {
        "id": "A002",
        "resourceType": "ACCOUNT",
        "label": "Saving account ****5678",
        "attributes": {"currency": "VND", "productType": "SAVING"}
      }
    ]
  },
  "active": true
}

### 4. Bind logical ACCOUNT_LIST to that provider for this demo consent type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reference/data-enrichment/bindings
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Actor-Type: {{actorType}}
X-Source-System: {{sourceSystem}}

{
  "dataType": "ACCOUNT_LIST",
  "consentTypeCode": "ACCOUNT_INFORMATION",
  "providerCode": "MOCK_ACCOUNT_BACKEND",
  "mappingProfileCode": null,
  "priority": 1,
  "configuration": {},
  "active": true
}

### 5. Declare that ACCOUNT_INFORMATION needs ACCOUNT_LIST during PREPARE_AUTHORIZATION
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reference/data-enrichment/requirements
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Actor-Type: {{actorType}}
X-Source-System: {{sourceSystem}}

{
  "consentTypeCode": "ACCOUNT_INFORMATION",
  "requirementCode": "accounts",
  "resolutionPhase": "PREPARE_AUTHORIZATION",
  "clientId": "tpp-001",
  "requiredScopes": ["accounts"],
  "dataType": "ACCOUNT_LIST",
  "dataPurpose": "SELECTION",
  "required": true,
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "freshnessSeconds": 60,
  "configuration": {
    "minSelections": 1,
    "maxSelections": 2,
    "presentation": {"title": "Select accounts"}
  },
  "active": true
}

### 6. Register a consent with no final account resource yet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consents
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: enrichment-register-demo-001
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: tpp-demo
X-Actor-Type: SERVICE
X-Correlation-Id: enrichment-demo-001
X-Request-Id: enrichment-register-001
X-Source-System: tpp-demo

{
  "externalRequestId": "enrichment-request-001",
  "consentType": "ACCOUNT_INFORMATION",
  "subjectId": "psu-001",
  "clientId": "tpp-001",
  "purpose": "Read selected account information",
  "validFrom": "2026-08-15T00:00:00Z",
  "validUntil": "2026-12-31T00:00:00Z",
  "acquisitionChannel": "WEB",
  "captureMethod": "IN_APP_CONFIRMATION",
  "sourceSystem": "tpp-demo",
  "externalConsentId": "enrichment-external-001",
  "evidencePolicy": "NOT_REQUIRED",
  "trustedSourceAuthorization": false,
  "capturedAt": "2026-08-15T12:00:00Z",
  "capturedBy": "tpp-demo",
  "content": {
    "purposeCode": "ACCOUNT_ACCESS",
    "permissions": [
      {"permissionCode": "READ_BALANCE", "attributes": {}}
    ],
    "resources": [],
    "constraints": [],
    "presentationSnapshot": {"title": "Account information consent"}
  }
}

> {% client.global.set("enrichmentConsentId", response.body.id); %}

### 7. First prepare: Core resolves backend data and asks Flow Manager/PSU for a selection
### Expected: preparationStatus=SELECTION_REQUIRED, consent status remains REGISTERED.
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/consents/{{enrichmentConsentId}}/prepare-authorization
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: enrichment-prepare-demo-001
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: flow-manager
X-Actor-Type: SERVICE
X-Correlation-Id: enrichment-demo-001
X-Source-System: flow-manager

{
  "clientId": "tpp-001",
  "scopes": ["accounts", "balances"],
  "subjectRef": "psu-001"
}

> {% client.global.set("selectionContextHash", response.body.selectionContextHash); %}

### 8. Submit PSU selection with SAME prepare idempotency key and returned candidate-set hash
### Core re-resolves backend data, validates selection, finalizes revision/hash and moves to AWAITING_AUTHORIZATION.
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/consents/{{enrichmentConsentId}}/prepare-authorization
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: enrichment-prepare-demo-001
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: flow-manager
X-Actor-Type: SERVICE
X-Correlation-Id: enrichment-demo-001
X-Source-System: flow-manager

{
  "clientId": "tpp-001",
  "scopes": ["accounts", "balances"],
  "subjectRef": "psu-001",
  "selectionContextHash": "{{selectionContextHash}}",
  "selections": {
    "accounts": ["A001"]
  }
}

### 9. Read final decision presentation (now allowed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/consents/{{enrichmentConsentId}}/presentation
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: flow-manager
X-Actor-Type: SERVICE
X-Source-System: flow-manager

### 10. Verify final immutable content contains only selected A001
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consents/{{enrichmentConsentId}}/revisions/current
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Actor-Type: {{actorType}}
X-Source-System: {{sourceSystem}}

### 11. Optional: list active enrichment configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reference/data-enrichment/requirements?consentTypeCode=ACCOUNT_INFORMATION&resolutionPhase=PREPARE_AUTHORIZATION
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Actor-Type: {{actorType}}
X-Source-System: {{sourceSystem}}
